window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>We shouldn't have ignored the threat lurking in the shadows. Now we're being taken to who knows where and our territory is on fire.</p> <p>We're fighting for our lives and the lives of the ones we love. Will we lose everything before our lives together have even begun?</p> <p>Nothing is what it seems in our world. Our saviors may just be our greatest enemies.</p> <p><i>Wolf Forged</i> is book 3 in the Arbor Falls series and is a reverse harem wolf shifter romance told in multiple POVs. It contains MM, mature scenes, language, and a cliffhanger.</p>"; 
